+- Weapons on the board (on by default; the Quest VR build's patch): Ratchet keeps his weapon, gadget or wrench as he rides. Circle fires it, Triangle opens the quick select to change it, Square swings the wrench (the board's own swing: his upper body twists and the wrench hits the enemies and crates in reach ahead). The Swingshot keeps him on the board: he swings and is pulled with the board at his feet and rides on as the swing ends, let go in the air or landed; a pull sets him down on the board at a standstill, held there until you push the stick. The board's button puts it away. Off: he puts his away and takes the wrench as he gets on, and Circle and Triangle do nothing while he rides.
