+
+// ---- What his state machine does with Circle and Triangle, which the ride skips ----
+// (update_hero_state_machine and process_hero_item_action_input, the NTSC decomp's names.) On foot,
+// Circle starts the held gun's own animation, which fires it as the item update plays it on, and
+// Triangle opens the quick select. Both are parts of his update, so on the board they are done here
